{
  "_comment": [
    "Every URL the current site publishes, and where it goes after docs/v2 is promoted to the root.",
    "GitHub Pages cannot do server-side redirects, so the export generates a stub page at each old",
    "path carrying rel=canonical, a meta refresh, and a visible link for anyone the refresh does not",
    "move. Without these, all 27 existing URLs 404 the moment v2 is promoted.",
    "",
    "index.html is deliberately absent: the old and new homepages share the same URL.",
    "",
    "kind=moved      the destination is the same content in its new home",
    "kind=superseded there is no direct equivalent yet, so this points at the nearest useful page and",
    "                the stub says so rather than pretending the content moved"
  ],
